flowchart TD
  A[Manager opens Shop cash day] --> B[Count and record opening float]
  B --> C[DailyClosing status OPEN]
  C --> D[Settled cash sale/deposit receipts]
  C --> E[Cash in / cash out / safe drops]
  C --> F[Cash refunds / deposit refunds]
  D --> G[Calculate expected cash]
  E --> G
  F --> G
  G --> H[Count notes and coins by denomination]
  H --> I[Variance = counted - expected]
  I --> J{Variance zero?}
  J -->|Yes| K[Manager closes day]
  J -->|No| L[Enter reason and manager closes]
  L --> K
  K --> M[DailyClosing immutable: CLOSED]
  M --> N{Post-close correction?}
  N -->|No| O[Keep final record]
  N -->|Yes| P[Manager creates audited correction]
  P --> O
